config APPLE_MESA_A9
	tristate "Apple A9 Mesa sensor AP-side power and status transport"
	depends on SPI
	depends on REGULATOR
	depends on ARCH_APPLE || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Power sequencing and a single SPI status transport for the Mesa
	  fingerprint sensor on Apple A9 (s8000/s8003) iPads.

	  This slice is deliberately inert: it cannot capture frames, upload
	  a sensor patch, provision the sensor or store keys. It is enabled
	  only by the mesa_a9.enable=1 module parameter, and every sensor
	  operation is an explicit debugfs write gated by CAP_SYS_RAWIO.

	  Say M here for Apple A9 iPads. The module will be called mesa-a9.
